        <p>It is said that up to the present time the Princess May's wedding presents, which were all on view at the White %15 om T"e6da.r, amount to a quarter of a million sterling. Many intended gifts have not yet been dclivered ; when they have all reached her hancia they will probably exceed the third part of a million of pounds. DEAR AT TkIE PRICE. —• • • -</p>
