      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1893-07-01_WidnesExaminer_art0102" n="art0102">
        <head>WARRINGTON TESTIMONIAL.</head>
        <p>A WARRINGTON TESTIMONIAL.</p>
        <p>Mrs. Vernon, 61, Aiken-st., Warrington, writes : June 13th, 1893.</p>
        <p>I must kindly thank Mr. Miller, for the benefit I have received from your Blectric Battery that I bought from you on the 3rd of June. I have been a great sufferer from rheumatism, and during the last three mont! I have been unable to close my fingers or bend my knees, but since I have had your Battery I can use my finger,' and Ineel down, and I feelbet ter both in health and s'rengtk. I auk yea for your advice."</p>
        <p>DEAFNESS. Read and investigate what a Wartirgt .71 gentleman -writes :</p>
        <p>49, B3wsey-strect, Warrington. June 23rd, 1893. J'. D. Miller. ieel very thankful t• you for your Electric Battery, Whiell I am ap:dying to my ars for Deafness. I hive been dolt for 4 to 5 3,!aral, and have been under the doetors hc-e, also at the Ear Hospital in Liverpool. but nothing ever gave me such relief as your Hlectric Battery, which I am plcarod to recommend. If any sue doubts this recommend, call at my address and I will fully convince you.</p>
        <p>I remain, Yours very truly, JAMES CRANNIGAN.</p>
        <p>A WARRINGTON TESTIMONIAL.</p>
        <p>Mr. Alexander Rigby, 9, Dixon-street, Warrington, sap— " I have been suffering from Rheumatism for more than three years. My legs and kneea used to swell terribly, and the pain was unbearable. I had also terrible weakness in the knees. I have tried doctors and herbalists, and I even went. at great expense, to Buxton Bath., but I got no better. I had a bill thrown into my house. and I read it. I then made up my mind to come and see you, at any rate, but I did not think I was going to get any benefit. I came and tried your treatment with the Blectrio batteries, and I am surprised at the Improvement I have made. I began to improve after the third day, and I keep getting better every day. The *menial; has gone down, and altogether I feel better of myself. I uae the Battery every day, as directed, and I feel the benefit trom it every time."</p>
        <p>We would further call your particular attention to the following</p>
        <p>CAUTION TO TI PUBLIC.</p>
        <p>Owing to the enormous success, snd the thousands of Cures effe.cted isy Electricity, parties without principle or honour have manufactured and sold at exhorbitaitt prices worthless appliances—Belts, Corsets, Bands, ac., assertin tt.ey were E;:ctr'e</p>
